{"text": "哪還有臉要您原諒", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["trap"], "note": "求原谅的意思,算道歉"}
{"text": "謝謝,謝謝您包涵", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "您別客氣,這是我們該做的", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "明兒就發,後兒到", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "dayafter"}], "tags": ["multi"], "note": ""}
{"text": "今兒下午發,週四保準到", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "today"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "thursday"}], "tags": ["multi"], "note": ""}
{"text": "三天,最多三天", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "3_days"}], "tags": ["short"], "note": ""}
{"text": "單子號碼發我,我讓人追", "frames": [{"act": "ask_order", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "預計什麼時候要?我們算算", "frames": [{"act": "ask_deadline", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "明白,您忙,不打擾了,再見", "frames": [{"act": "closing", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "不好意思我们太晚,明天发出去了", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们的错,我们没做好", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "货物在海关了,所以晚", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "customs"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我给你加急,今天,好吗", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你的订单号几号?", "frames": [{"act": "ask_order", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你需要什么时候?我可以快", "frames": [{"act": "ask_deadline", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "星期四我们保证送到你家", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "thursday"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们会补发货,明天,你放心", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "折扣没有,抱歉啊", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "-", "pct": null}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner", "neg"], "note": ""}
{"text": "可以给你一个优惠,九折", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 10}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我给你小礼物好不好?", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "没有赔钱的", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner", "neg"], "note": ""}
{"text": "好,好,我同意你", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "谢谢你等,下次再来", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "closing", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你好,有什么问题吗", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们不是不想发,是仓库没货", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "stock"}], "tags": ["double_neg"], "note": "不是不想发=想发但缺货,没有重发的承诺"}
{"text": "你说我们没有回复,可是我们昨天回了", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["quote"], "note": ""}
{"text": "客人说要等,我们就等", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们没有说不赔,只是要等主管", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["double_neg"], "note": "只说没有拒绝,并未提出补偿"}
{"text": "不会不退钱,您放心", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["double_neg"], "note": ""}
{"text": "不能不给您发,我们明天一定发", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["double_neg"], "note": ""}
{"text": "绝不是不愿赔不是,实在对不住", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["double_neg"], "note": ""}
{"text": "要是我们早点发,你就不会等", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["hypo"], "note": ""}
{"text": "如果你同意改发顺丰,我给你免运费", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "要是你接受晚三天,我们打九五折", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 5}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "说好的周三,我们没办到,这是我们的问题", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "周三那个日期我想取消,改周五", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "friday"}], "tags": ["trap"], "note": "取消周三改周五"}
{"text": "原计划明天发,取消了,改成后天发", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "dayafter"}], "tags": ["trap"], "note": ""}
{"text": "本来想送你券,后来老板说不行", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["trap", "neg"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们不会拒绝您的要求,可以补发", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": null}], "tags": ["double_neg"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这个我们真没办法,您多包涵", "frames": [{"act": "refuse", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "你是说想要退款?我们看看", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["quote", "question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你说\"退款\",可以,马上", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["quote"], "note": "同意买家提出的退款,记为agree"}
{"text": "老板问你,是不是要加急", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "快递小哥说周四到", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["quote"], "note": ""}
{"text": "订单我们已经交给快递公司了", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "快递公司已经发出了,但是路上堵", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "logistics"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "哎,台风,没办法啊", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "weather"}], "tags": ["short"], "note": ""}
{"text": "厂里放假,所以才晚", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "factory"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "因为双十一,单太多了", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "other"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "嗯,那个,就是,抱歉,货,货在路上", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["filler"], "note": ""}
{"text": "请放心,我们周五前一定到", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "friday"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "您的心情我懂,这事换了我也恼火", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["comfort"], "note": ""}
{"text": "谢谢你提醒我们", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "你是对的,我们应该提前通知你", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "吃了没?哈哈,开玩笑,说正事", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["offtopic"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您看这样行不行,我们周六发,您再等等", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "saturday"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "退货的话,运费我们出", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "给您加急,加急费我们出", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "就这样吧,祝您顺利", "frames": [{"act": "closing", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "您好,抱歉让您久等,明天一早补发,周五前到,另给九折", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "friday"}, {"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 10}], "tags": ["multi"], "note": ""}
{"text": "错在我们,先给您赔不是,货明天走空运", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}, {"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["multi"], "note": ""}
{"text": "海关扣了,我们没辙,但送您券一张", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "customs"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["multi"], "note": ""}
{"text": "不是我们的问题,是物流压件,折扣就不给了", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "logistics"}, {"act": "discount", "pol": "-", "pct": null}], "tags": ["multi", "neg"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您要是再等两天,我给您八折加免运", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 20}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["conditional", "multi"], "note": ""}
{"text": "单号发来,我催一催", "frames": [{"act": "ask_order", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["short"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您最晚哪天要,给个准话", "frames": [{"act": "ask_deadline", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "多谢多谢,您这么理解我们", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "好说好说,就照您的意思", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "您说\"不要补发,要退款\",行,依您", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["quote"], "note": "同意买家提议,记为agree"}
{"text": "不好意思,是我们疏忽,更换新的给您,后天一定到", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": null}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "dayafter"}], "tags": ["multi"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您别着急,没事,这单我们盯着", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["comfort"], "note": ""}
{"text": "好,周日前一定送到", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "sunday"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "不是我不想快,是航班一周才两班", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "logistics"}], "tags": ["trap"], "note": ""}
{"text": "本来想走顺丰给您,可惜这个地区不到", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["trap", "neg"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您那边要是不急,我们就走普通件", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["hypo"], "note": ""}
{"text": "优先发货这个事,我们做不到", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["neg"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您刚才说\"要折扣\",这个我们没有", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "-", "pct": null}], "tags": ["quote", "neg"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您说发货太慢,我们认了", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["quote"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您说\"不要赔偿\",那我们就不送券了", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["quote", "neg"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您说\"要退款\",我们不退", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["quote", "neg"], "note": ""}
{"text": "不要紧,不要紧,我们这边处理", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["comfort"], "note": ""}
{"text": "没关系,您慢慢说,我听着呢", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["comfort"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这事儿我一人说了不算,得看领导脸色", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["idiom"], "note": ""}
{"text": "手头紧归手头紧,您的单我先垫上运费加急", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["idiom"], "note": ""}
{"text": "给您添麻烦了,往后一定注意", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["idiom"], "note": ""}
{"text": "赶明儿给您发,您就瞧好吧", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": null}], "tags": ["idiom"], "note": "赶明儿时间不定"}
{"text": "货物已经在路上了,您看看物流信息", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "周二到,那个我们办不到", "frames": [{"act": "refuse", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["neg"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您要优惠?行,先说好,九折封顶", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 10}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "哪里哪里,您太客气了", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["short"], "note": ""}
{"text": "多亏您提醒,这才发现漏发了", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "漏发了,下午补上,明天晚上前到", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "today"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["multi"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您要的不是折扣,是个说法,对吧", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "说法我们一定给,先查清楚", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "先给您退点钱,您消消火,别去投诉", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "别投诉呀,求您了,我们补偿您", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "补偿?那我得问问财务", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "赔偿的话,按规定,不到一周不赔", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["neg"], "note": ""}
{"text": "请您再给我们一次机会", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "敬请见谅,我们再也不会了", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "失敬失敬,是我们怠慢了", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": "没有使用道歉词,只承认怠慢"}
{"text": "这次的事,我给您赔礼", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "今天礼拜二对吧,那就礼拜四", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "thursday"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "明天?后天?我这就去问仓库", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "两天内到", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "2_days"}], "tags": ["short"], "note": ""}
{"text": "一周内发,您等得了吗", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "7_days"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "不管怎样,这单我们送到底", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "辛苦您,请稍等", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "以后买东西,记得提前下单哈", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
{"text": "这笔运费我们先不收了,算赔您的时间", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": [], "note": ""}
